'''Luke's hut''' was a hut resided in by [[Jedi Master]] [[Luke Skywalker]] at his [[Jedi Temple of Luke Skywalker|Jedi temple]] on [[Ossus]] where he [[Jedi training|trained]] a [[Jedi Order|new generation of Jedi]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="Shadow of the Sith" />

In [[21 ABY]],<ref name="Shadow date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of ''[[Shadow of the Sith]]'' to [[21 ABY]].</ref> Skywalker spotted [[Enyo]] from his hut instructing a group of [[Jedi Initiate|younglings]] through a series of exercises with [[Training lightsaber|training blades]].<ref name="Shadow of the Sith" />

The hut was [[Destruction of the Jedi Temple|destroyed]] along with the whole temple during a confrontation between him and his nephew [[Ben Solo]]<ref name="Episode VII" /> in [[28 ABY]].<ref name="Date" />

